{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Eisenhower 是一款以四象限矩陣整理任務的待辦工具，適合工作、學習、副業或行程繁忙的人使用。它把任務分成現在要做、排程、委派與不做，協助你看清下一步該專注什麼。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>四象限矩陣與專注模式</h2>\n<p>它以四象限矩陣按緊急與重要程度分類任務，分成立即處理、排程、委派與不做，每張清單最多八項以保持焦點，並可記錄無限任務與筆記。專注模式可選一項重要任務，設定三十分鐘或自訂計時器；亦可把任務加入行事曆或交給同事，並透過雲端同步與網頁版保持即時一致。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-1-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-2-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-3-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-4-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-5-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Eisenhower</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/eisenhower/id547099449?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:08.622849+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":289,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T18:10:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.790484+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:10.790484+00:00","content_hash":"9f98a0d5727bc3009464c4a067e5673d45505e2e903cde7cfa03ee70d30de2eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}